{
  "id": "EPH.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "EPH",
  "reference": "Abaefeso 4",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obomo bw’omobere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, inche omosibwa ase engencho y’Omonene nabasoroire mogenderere buna egwenerete okorangerigwa kwaino mwarangereretigwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ase obokanyeku bwonsi na obwororo, na ase oboremereria mokobogorerania ase obwanchani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mokore omokia konyora obomo bw’Omoika ase egesibo ki’omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omobere n’oyoomo, na Omoika n’oyoomo, buna mwarangeretigwe ase ogosemeria okomo gw’okorangerigwa kwaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene oyomo, okwegena okomo, ebatiso eyemo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae oyomo, ore Tata o bonsi, ere ore igoro ase bonsi, goetera ase bonsi, na ime ase bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende kera oyomo oito naetwe obuya koreng’ana n’ekerengo gi’ekeegwa gia Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nigo agoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ekero ageendete igoro, akaira abasakore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akaa Mwanyabaanto ebiegwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Gaki, ring’ana eri, “Ageendete igoro”, engencho yaye inki otatiga naboigo aigete nonya ngoika ensemo yainse y’ense?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyoigete nere oyio ogendete boigo igoro ya igoro, erinde ebinto bionsi biichorwe nere.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akarua abande babe abatomwa, na abande ababani, na abande abarandia, na abande abarisia, na abande aboorokia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakora bo ase ogoikerania abachenu ase emeremo y’obosomba, goika omobere o Kristo oagachwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo goika intwe twensi tonyaare goikera obomo bw’okwegena, na komanya mono Omwana o Nyasae, na koba omonto omoikeranu, goika ekerengo ki’ogokiina kw’ogoichorwa gwa Kristo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde titoba naende abana ebing’werere, bagotumatumigwa aaria na aaria, na koirurukigwa ase kera embeo y’okworokereria, ase obong’ainereria bw’abaanto, ekero bakobang’aina kobwatia chiinchera chi’okobasiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tokwane ekeene ase obwanchani, tokiine goika toikere Kristo ase chiinchera chionsi; nere ore omotwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase are ere omobere bwonsi onyare gokiina ogokiina kw’omobere na kweagaacha omonyene ase obwanchani, korasang’ananigwe na kobwatanigwa ase ogokoonywa gwa kera ekiimo koreng’ana n’emeremo ya kera ensemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obogima obokoro na boria oboyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ’ngokwana nde ring’ana eri, na koba kirori ase Omonene; korwa bono timogeenda buna abanto b’Ebisaku bakogeenda ase ebirengorerio biabo bitari nengeencho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini bwabo bwabekirwe omosunte, barusananiigwe korwa ase obogima bwa Nyasae ekiagera ase ogotamanya koria kore ime ase bare ase engencho y’obokong’u bwe chinkoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinkoro chiabo chiabeire n’amagandi, bebeekire ase chingeencho chiimbe chi’omobere, erio ase obwegimeria banyaare gokora kera engencho y’eubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe timworokereretigwe komomanya Kristo ase enchera eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mwamoigwete na kworokererigwa nere, buna ekeene kere ime ase Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rusia chingeencho chiaino chi’eritang’ani chi’oboMwanyabaanto bwa kare, obwasariigwe ase okobwatia okogania kw’obong’ainereria;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mokorwe abayia ase emeika na ebirengererio biaino,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mweboyie omonto omoyia, oyotongetwe ase omogwekano o Nyasae ase oboronge na obochenu bw’ekeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emeroberio y’obogima oboyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki aboria oborimo, mokw’ane ekeene kera omonto nomogisangio oye, inaki nigo tore ebiimo ebimo intwe ase intwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobee, korende timokora ebibe; erioba tiriigwa na inwe more n’endamwamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose timoa Saitani ribaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoibi taiba naende; mbuya akore emeremo ase omokia namaboko aye na gokora ayare amaya, erinde abe negento akomwatanera oyoremeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogokwana okobe tikorua ase emenwa yaino, korende okore okuya na okoranyaare kobaa obuya abwo bagokoigwa na koagaacha abaganeirie koagaachwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose timoichania Omoika Omochenu o Nyasae, ase are ere oyomwabegetwe ekemanyererio goika rituko ri’okoboorigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obororo bwonsi, na endamwamu, na okobea, na eriomana, na emerumi birusigwe ase more, amo n’obobe bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobe nobwororo inwe ase inwe, mororerane amabeebe, na kwaberana inwe ase inwe, buna Nyasae ase Kristo abaaberete inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
